 ilyn Pérez\n- Lisette Oropesa\n- Lawrence Brownlee\n- Ricardo José River
 a\n- Christian van Horn\n- Tony Stevenson\n- David Pittsinger\n- Eve Gigli
 otti\n\n\n(synopsis non encore traduit sur TMDB)\nWhen it comes to beautif
 ul melodies\, captivating coloratura and virtuoso vocal fireworks\, few op
 eras can match Bellini's I puritani. The action takes place in England dur
 ing the civil war between Royalists and Puritans. At its heart is the trag
